#   implementation_intent ......... Qwen3.6-27B (off)      judge 5  [dedicated knob]
#   generate + sections (MODEL) ... gemma-4-31b (off)      judge 4, ~14s (Qwen runaway, coder slower j3.5)
#   builder_review ................ qwen3-coder-next (off) judge 4, only 100%-valid j4
#   refine ........................ Qwen3.6-27B (off)      judge 4.5 (beats coder j4 + faster)
#   judge (gatekeeper) ............ gemma-4-31b (ON)       judge 5  [per-role thinking flag]
#   autonomous repair ............. gemma-4-31b (off)      judge 4.5, ~7.5s (fastest + best)
#   revise_after_judge (MODEL) .... gemma-4-31b (off)      judge 4
#   nd summarize + package ........ qwen3-coder-next (off) judge 5 / 4.5
#   nd handoff .................... gemma-4-31b (off)      judge 5, ~5s (fastest + best)
#   chat/intake/context-fallback .. gemma-4-31b (off)
